  triage:description "After PackageVersion in .winget/randlee.agent-team-mail.yaml was correctly updated to 1.3.2-beta.25 (resolving AI25-QA-002), the ManifestVersion field on line 27 was left at 1.3.1. The version mismatch causes just lint to fail its consistency check. arch-ctm's FINAL PASS self-report for FIX-1 claimed all validation gates passed; this is inaccurate for just lint due to this stale field." ;
